<title>SINGAPORE: Metalock year net profit plunges 20.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Metalock year net profit plunges 20.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     1.94	vs	2.44</p>
<p>    Dividend (cts)	 2.50	vs	2.50</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)    8.07	vs     10.16</p>
<p>    Turnover		32.59	vs     32.93</p>
<p>    Other income	   0.73	vs	0.66</p>
<p>    Interest expense     0.18	vs	0.16</p>
